sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant N as nginx
  participant L as Liberty monolith
  participant D as Db2
  participant C as Quarkus catalog
  participant P as Postgres
  participant K as Kafka

  U->>N: GET Customer
  N->>L: /jaxrs/Customer
  L->>D: load CUSTOMER + address
  D-->>L: PII row
  L-->>U: customer JSON

  U->>N: GET Product?categoryId=
  N->>C: strangler route
  C->>P: product query
  P-->>C: catalog rows
  C-->>U: products JSON

  U->>N: PUT Product price
  N->>C: update
  C->>P: persist price
  C->>K: product-price-updated
  K-->>C: ProductPriceChanged consumer
